WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.240
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.260
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.290
Just a little more,

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.180
Just a little bit more,

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.720
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:27.550
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.760
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:36.490
You smiled at me,

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:42.520
Like a leaf swaying in the wind.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:49.240
It seems as though my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.330
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.020
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.160
Just a little more,

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.050
Just a little bit more,

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.970
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:09.620
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.820
And understand what I'm saying to you!

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.640
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:21.660
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:42.490
This'll do for now.

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:44.290
Amamiya-san!

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:46.040
I'm finished with this section!

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:50.080
Listen, Amamiya-san...

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:52.840
We have to decide where to put our shop soon...

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:57.630
Why don't we look at the layout from last year and discuss it?

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:00.600
What event should we organize this year?

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:02.640
What about that idea?

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.930
I'll prepare the proposal.

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:07.770
Amamiya-san, about the budget...

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.150
Let's discuss it with Sakurai-kun.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:12.150
We might need a bit more.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:13.320
Hey, everyone!

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.650
How are the preparations going?

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.530
Sakurai-kun!

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:17.950
Good timing.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.320
We need to discuss the budget with you.

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:21.200
Now, now!

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.200
Let's leave the difficult stuff for later.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:24.370
More importantly, here you go!

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:25.160
I got you some snacks!

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:29.870
Honestly!

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:32.710
All right everyone, let's take a break.

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:34.420
All right!

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:36.550
This is great!

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:41.720
Let's talk about the budget after the break, Sakurai-kun.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:49.440
Well, I guess I should take a break too.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:54.940
An Exciting Evening

00:02:55.570 --> 00:03:00.110
Summer vacation's over now, so we need to discuss the budget.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.320
We can talk about that tomorrow!

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:06.080
The Student Council is on holiday for three days starting tomorrow.

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.330
I'll be on a trip with my parents, so I won't be here either.

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:11.670
Oh, that'll be a problem...

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:17.960
Riku-kun!

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.630
The board says:Culture Festival Student Council Temporary Headquarters

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:21.380
K-Kasuga-san!

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:22.390
What is it?

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:26.100
Oh geez! I wanted to see you, so I escaped from my training!

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:29.230
D-Don't hug me like that!

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:30.480
Oh, you're blushing!

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:31.890
That's so cute!

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:33.900
Oh, Aoba-kun!

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:34.940
She's doing it again today!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.480
She never gets tired of it.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.650
I wish they'd stop it. It's so hot these days.

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.950
Easier said than done.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:42.450
Tsukasa!

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:48.080
Captain!

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:52.540
You always disappear in the middle of training!

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:53.920
Behave yourself!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.500
Come this way. Now!

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.380
No! I'm gonna be separated from Riku-kun!

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.590
Riku-kun! Let's go home together today!

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:06.350
You're not getting away that easily!

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.600
I'll put you through hell today!

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:09.770
Sorry to bother you!

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:13.350
Oh, Kasuga-san!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:18.480
We're never bored as long as you're here!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:20.150
I have a good feeling about this!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.780
That's true. He's never boring.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.610
Yeah, no kidding! Honestly!

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:47.180
So, you'll be taking a break from the
Culture Festival preparations tomorrow?

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.680
It seems that quite a few
people are gonna be busy.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.020
So now I'll have some free time.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:59.440
Speaking of the Student Council, Amamiya-san's really into it!

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:01.190
Really into it?

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:06.200
Well, whenever I go to see you, she's working hard on her own.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:10.370
She's so hard working that she's not very approachable.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:11.410
Just kidding.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.620
I don't think that's the case.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:15.710
You think so?

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:17.830
Oh, that's right.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.960
Listen, Kasuga-san.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:20.670
Yes?

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:22.670
Can you take a day off from training tomorrow...

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:26.550
Sorry! The volleyball team's training camp starts tomorrow!

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:27.970
I'll bring you back a souvenir!

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:28.720
See ya!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:31.680
I guess I have no choice.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.640
I'll just have to relax at home for a while.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:38.730
What's this? A message?

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:50.450
Everyone!

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.040
What's wrong, you guys?

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.670
What the hell happened here?

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.760
We-We've got no money!

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:09.390
Thank you very much!

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.390
You're terrible!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:17.690
You ate at a family restaurant, even
though you didn't bring any money with you.

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:20.100
Sorry we made you pay for it.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:23.190
I owe you one. I'll pay you back
when I get a part-time job.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:25.190
Oh yeah!

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:27.700
Why did you suddenly start looking for a part-time job?

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:32.200
Well, we spent too much money during
the summer vacation, so our allowances are all gone!

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.660
There's still something we want to do this summer.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.120
There are some parts I wanna buy.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:40.210
We decided to earn some money while we still have some time.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:46.550
So, why did you ask me?

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:50.630
Well, what job should we apply for?

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.600
Oh, how about this?

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:55.470
Staff wanted at a cafe run by boys with glasses.

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:58.680
What about the ad for "costumed heroes needed urgently"?

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:00.730
The pay looks good.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:03.150
What about what I want?

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.440
I overheard everything!

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:09.150
You're...

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:12.620
Hi! Sorry for the wait!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:14.120
Onee-san!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:15.580
How'd you get there?

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:18.500
Don't worry about the details!

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.870
Besides, you're looking for jobs, aren't you?

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.130
Well, yes...

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.800
You're in luck!

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:29.130
I have information on some great jobs for you!

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:32.510
For real?

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:35.720
Yes. They're all high-paying jobs!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.310
So, what'll it be?

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:38.140
What should I do?

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.100
Listen, everyone...

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.520
We should think about it a little...

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.060
All right! I'll take this one!

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:45.060
Please sign here!

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.400
OK, I'll be going now...

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.610
Riku-kun!

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:53.950
Don't be so cold! Hang out with us!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:59.160
But, I don't want a part-time job!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.580
There, now it's settled!

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:06.750
Starting tomorrow, I'll be counting on you!

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.590
All right! I'm gonna earn tons of money!

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:12.170
Our vacation's almost over, so I'll
need money to make the most of it!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:13.930
YEAH!!!

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.720
Why me?

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:20.930
I agree to pay her 30% of my
salary as a fee for finding me the job.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.940
Comic
Festival

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:45.790
Secur

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.960
All right everyone, you'll be in charge of helping out around here!

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.750
Please be wary of strangers.

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.510
Spacing out won't help.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.800
Anyway, let's get to work.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:55.970
What should we do?

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.510
This is heaven.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:59.680
This is paradise!

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:00.970
What is it, Yuusuke?

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:10.480
There is so much excitement here before me. I'm overflowing with excitement!

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:11.820
Yuusuke?

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:18.870
Treasure! This is a mountain of treasure!

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.830
That's mine!

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:26.000
Don't break it!

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:28.670
I did it!

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:31.000
I got the latest edition of this doll!

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:33.510
I can die happy now!

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:35.220
Geez!

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.800
Don't act like that!

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:42.810
Summer Sale!
Huge Bargains!

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.810
Please do it properly this time.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:48.350
[Signs say: Huge Sales, Big Bargains.]

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:53.320
You'll have to deal with customers here.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.320
Make sure you give them the correct directions.

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:58.950
Is that all? This'll be easy!

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.370
Really?

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.330
Don't worry about it!

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.830
It'll be fine!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:09.330
We will now begin the Time Sale!

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.980
Old ladies are scary...

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:37.030
Geez!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:39.950
Can't you do ANYTHING right?

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.080
What should I do?

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.490
You're in the way!

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:50.210
Please do the next job properly!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.460
Hurry up! Let's go!

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:58.380
Why are we in such a suspicious place?

00:10:58.670 --> 00:10:59.470
Aoba.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:01.800
Don't panic.

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:03.550
I let my guard down earlier.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.470
This time, I'll protect you!

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:07.470
Doujima-kun!

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.020
Wow! They're so cute!

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:14.400
Well, I'll let you sort them into groups based on their gender.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.280
Thank goodness.

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.110
It looks like this'll work out somehow.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:32.360
Ah! What the hell are you looking at?!

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.710
Oh crap! Is that him?

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:40.170
Hiyoko defeated me!

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:46.430
Back then, and then, and then too!

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.770
He's terrifying!

00:11:58.230 --> 00:11:59.780
NOOOO!!!

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:03.530
Even his footsteps strike fear into my heart!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:10.370
That yellow devil! That yellow devil! He defeated me!

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:11.080
What the hell is wrong with you?!

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:13.420
What are you doing here, Hiyoko-kun?

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:16.910
What? I did a little business with a friend outside, sort of.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:24.010
Tokimeki Memorial: Only Love. I'm Hiyoko.

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:28.890
Tokimeki Memorial! I'm the cafeteria lady! Only Love!

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:30.680
Honestly!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.730
He's got no balls at all!

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:34.900
He should learn from his elders.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.900
I told him to behave himself!

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:38.570
Honestly!

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:40.980
I don't care either way...

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.030
Listen up!

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:46.660
This is the last job, got it?

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:55.540
Signs Says: Pet Store.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.000
They're always making such a racket.

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:04.300
Wow! There are so many different types of animals here!

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:06.130
They're so cute!

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:08.050
Well then, I'll leave the rest to you.

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:09.760
That's my line.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:29.280
I should've known that these dogs would be so aggressive!

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:30.910
You don't have time to lounge around!

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:32.240
Here!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.580
Clean the cages! That's your punishment!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.710
DO IT NOW!

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.000
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:43.380
What's he up to?

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.440
It's too bad.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:05.030
The Student Council is on holiday until tomorrow.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:09.910
And I came all this way to see Aoba-san.

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:12.240
HEEEEY!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.290
Was that... Aoba-san?

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:15.250
Wait!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:22.880
Can't you run a little slower?

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:25.590
Wait!

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:36.430
A-Aoba-san...

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:39.520
He looks pretty busy...

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.940
I've taken them for their walk.

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:49.910
Huh?

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.660
Was this dog here before?

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:53.490
Good work.

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.740
It must've been hard to take them for a walk.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:58.160
Oh, no. Not really.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:01.790
Um... who's that big dog over there?

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:03.750
Oh, L?

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.880
A regular customer asked us to look after him.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:10.550
Shouldn't I take him out for a walk?

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:13.640
Well, to be honest, he's very shy.

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:17.060
I've never seen him eat, either.

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.230
Is that so?

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:21.900
But, he's very friendly towards his owner, though.

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:25.940
Honestly, I don't know where he gets it.

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:33.280
Hey! Come over here!

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.120
Come on, MOVE!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.620
We finally made it.

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:44.960
Well, I guess you haven't
exercised much, so let's play all day today.

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:52.550
Let's go, L.

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:53.930
Fetch!

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:03.690
Don't you like balls?

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:06.940
How about this, then?

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:09.190
Look, L!

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:10.530
Doesn't it look delicious?

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.200
What about this?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:18.450
It's a fun toy!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:22.540
All right then! How about this?

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:23.830
Or this?

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:24.750
Or this?

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:31.410
Listen here Riku, an animal's feelings should not treated lightly.

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:41.100
I, Hiyoko-kun, shall show my graceful neck.

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:46.280
I wonder if I could meet you sooner if I showed myself.

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:50.070
He's pretty late.

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:53.070
I think this is a shortcut.

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:59.120
It's no good.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.830
He's not interested in anything.

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:15.180
L?

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:16.260
You...

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.810
OK! Here we go, L!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:32.940
Nice catch!

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:39.570
You're good at this, L!

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:48.460
Hey, where are you going, L?

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:50.380
What's going on?

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:02.100
L!

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:16.490
But, how did you end up here?

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:19.950
Did you run away from the pet store?

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:24.120
Wh-What's wrong?

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.290
Stop! That tickles!

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:29.290
Oh, L!

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:32.750
Amamiya-san?

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:36.630
A-Aoba-kun!

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.560
I never thought that he'd be your dog, Amamiya-san.

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:51.650
It really surprised me.

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:56.440
I didn't know that you were working there either.

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:58.740
Well, a lot of stuff happened...

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:01.740
But, I'm quite surprised.

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:06.540
He's usually very quiet, and he's very shy around strangers.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.790
He certainly seems that way.

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.420
That's what the owner of the store said.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:14.380
And besides, he doesn't like playing with other dogs.

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:16.420
So it's quite troublesome.

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:19.590
I had to find someone to look after him during our trip.

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.300
I see.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:22.300
So that's what happened.

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:24.470
What do you mean?

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:28.270
I'm sure he resembles his owner.

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:30.770
L's like me?

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:31.480
Yeah.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:35.980
Amamiya-san, you were working for the Student Council on your own, weren't you?

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.690
Y-Yes.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:41.820
You have a unique aura when you're working like that.

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:45.330
Like you're really dedicated, or there's something special inside your heart...

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.370
I wonder...

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:49.540
Yes, there is.

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:52.120
I'm sure that L wants to be like you, Amamiya-san.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:52.790
Right?

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:01.010
I don't think that's true.

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:03.930
What do you mean?

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.470
Hey, L! What are you doing?

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:10.140
I think he wants to play some more.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:14.690
C'mon! You should play with us too!

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:19.940
Okay! Let's go, L!

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:38.800
Wait!

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:49.310
The new term starts tomorrow.

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:50.810
That's true.

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:55.440
We'll have to work hard on the culture festival preparations before summer vacation's over.

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:58.110
Um...

00:20:58.520 --> 00:20:59.360
Well...

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:03.110
Oh yeah!

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:06.280
Please ask me to help you instead of working by yourself.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.240
I'll give you a hand.

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:11.950
All right. I'll be counting on you.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:13.870
Yeah!

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:18.460
Oh, my house is this way, so...

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:22.630
OK, I'll see you tomorrow at school.

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:27.180
Let's play together again, L.

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.510
What's wrong, L?

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:33.520
Is there something over there?

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:49.620
You skipped work, didn't you?!

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:56.960
I was so focused on playing with L that I forgot to call the store!

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:02.880
I'll show you what happens when you ignore your job!

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:05.170
Play with him, boys!

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:08.220
Aoba-kun!

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:12.260
How did this happen?

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:37.210
When the morning sunlight streams through the window,

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:42.250
I immediately think of you.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:54.220
Our love began at first sight.

00:22:55.140 --> 00:23:00.230
We have a bright future!

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:06.650
Because you are my destined man!

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:17.330
I've always been searching for the feeling which broke my smile.

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:24.340
I have grasped a piece of the miracle which fell into this world

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:30.260
I will run toward you, my love!

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:35.930
When we are together, we can overcome any obstacle!

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:42.560
Our love is still young, but it's my treasure!

00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:53.410
Tell me your cellphone number, Sakurai-kun.

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:54.320
Oh dear! What'll I do?

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:56.870
It's tough being popular!

00:23:56.870 --> 00:23:58.490
C'mon, hurry!

00:23:58.490 --> 00:24:01.370
Come to think of it, aren't you Aoba-kun's girlfriend?

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:03.040
Never mind that. Just tell me!

00:24:03.110 --> 00:24:04.630
Guess I've got no choice!

00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:05.320
Let's see...

00:24:05.670 --> 00:24:08.400
Next time on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:08.550 --> 00:24:10.050
An Exciting Memory.

00:24:10.050 --> 00:24:11.020
Please watch it.

00:24:12.710 --> 00:24:16.510
Now I'll be able to contact Riku-kun at the culture festival!

00:24:16.700 --> 00:24:18.730
Am I your go-between?
